  "support": "A large grey limestone block, the front face of which angles in towards the base. Broken at the left end, intact above, below and to the right. The rear right corner has been cut away, and there is a recessed clamp hole on the upper face towards the rear right corner. Roughly finished on all sides except the front face. ",
